    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; appetite normal</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No restlessness, stiffness, tremor, seizures, or episodes of lost time</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>Left ear wound healed; hearing unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Night-time perceptual disturbances at sleep onset; low mood improving; passive thoughts of not waking up less often; no suicidal intent or plan</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
